IMPORT prelude
-- EVERY-EACH-QUANTIFIER-SPEC, phase 1: the WHO filter (spec §2.1).
--
-- The filter is a Boolean expression in which the bound variable is in scope.
-- (The spec's §2.1 point-free reading, `WHO member_of tenants` with the
-- variable inserted as the first argument, is not built: write the variable.)
-- PROVISIONAL R-Q4: `WHO` is the only filter word; `WHERE` keeps its meaning.

DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF
    Landlord HAS name IS A STRING
    Tenant   HAS name IS A STRING

DECLARE Action IS ONE OF
    Sign HAS signer IS AN Actor

tenants MEANS LIST (Tenant OF "Alice"), (Tenant OF "Bob"), (Tenant OF "Carol")

-- the filter on its own line
GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
`the listed tenants sign` MEANS
    EVERY Tenant t IN tenants
        MUST   Sign (EXACTLY t)
        WITHIN 14
        ONCE   ALL HAVE
        HENCE  FULFILLED
        LEST   BREACH

-- the filter inline, and the cast narrowed further by a comparison
GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Action
`everyone but Carol signs` MEANS
    EVERY Tenant t WHO NOT (t EQUALS Tenant OF "Carol") MUST Sign (EXACTLY t) WITHIN 14
